<p>Someone asked to reset the password for your Good Sorcery account.</p>

<p><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(token: @user.password_reset_token), class: "button" %></p>

<p class="muted">
  This link expires in <%= distance_of_time_in_words(0, @user.password_reset_token_expires_in) %>.
  If you didn't ask for this, you can ignore this email and your password stays the same.
</p>
